        "title": "Integumentary System",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "FUNCTIONS:\n  Barrier: physical, chemical, microbial\n  Thermoregulation: vasodilation/constriction, sweat, piloerection\n  Sensation: touch, pressure, vibration, temperature, pain, proprioception\n  Vitamin D synthesis: UVB → D3 precursor\n  Immune sentinel: Langerhans cells, innate immune peptides\n  Water retention: stratum corneum lipids prevent transepidermal water loss\n  Communication: flushing, pallor, sweating, blushing (autonomic visible output)\n```"
    },
